<title>UK: North Rhine-Westphalia sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>North Rhine-Westphalia sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORTH RHINE-WESTPHALIA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN MARK  COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    22.JAN.14</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.06    PAY DATE   S22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    99.87     SPREAD	+43 BP</p>
<p> S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    21 BP     SELL CONC  19 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
